6446733 1072 #uuid "463f0d10-4286-59ff-a21d-e7909700880b" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446733 1074 "Let's start by writing the matrix $M-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nM-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{13}-\\lambda  & \\sqrt{17} \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{2}-\\lambda \\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(M-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{13}-\\lambda  & \\sqrt{17} \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{2}-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (\\sqrt{13}-\\lambda )(\\frac{1}{2}-\\lambda )-0\\cdot \\sqrt{17} & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -\\sqrt{13})(\\lambda -\\frac{1}{2}) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =\\sqrt{13}$ and $\\lambda =\\frac{1}{2}.$\n\n**Note:** The eigenvalues of a triangular (or diagonal) matrix are the entries on the main diagonal." 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446734 1068 #edb/ref 17592186446729 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446734 1069 "q-106996" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446734 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446734 1071 "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$C=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446734 1072 #uuid "4f368600-216e-5acd-8869-df093ce09e0f" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446734 1074 "Let's start by writing the matrix $C-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nC-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}7-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(C-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(C-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}7-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (7-\\lambda )(-2-\\lambda )-0\\cdot 0 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -7)(\\lambda +2) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =7$ and $\\lambda =-2.$\n\n**Note:** The eigenvalues of a triangular (or diagonal)