B-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(B-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-8-\\lambda  & 7 \\\\ -9 & 8-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-8-\\lambda )(8-\\lambda )-7\\cdot (-9) & =0 \\\\ -64+8\\lambda -8\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+63 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-1 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda +1)(\\lambda -1) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =-1$ and $\\lambda =1.$" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446740 1068 #edb/ref 17592186446728 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446740 1069 "q-106988" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446740 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446740 1071 "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$Q=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -9 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446740 1072 #uuid "86473df3-55aa-5a6b-9f10-9b94fded00fc" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446740 1074 "Let's start by writing the matrix $Q-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nQ-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}4-\\lambda  & -9 \\\\ 2 & -3-\\lambda \\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(Q-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(Q-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}4-\\lambda  & -9 \\\\ 2 & -3-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (4-\\lambda )(-3-\\lambda )-2\\cdot (-9) & =0 \\\\ -12-4\\lambda +3\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+18 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda +6 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the discriminant of the quadratic equation above, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =(-1)^{2}-4\\cdot 1\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =1-24 \\\\  & =-23 \\\\  & <0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the characteristic equation does not have real solutions and therefore $Q$ does not have real eigenvalues." 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446741 1068 #edb/ref 17592186446722 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446741 1069 "q-106954" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446741 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446741 1071 "Find the characteristic equation of the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446741 1072 #uuid "8a11188a-8a0f-5ab5-9de2-8d85b1d9c9bc" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446741 1074 "First, we find the matrix $\\,A-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nA-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}1-\\lambda  & -2 \\\\ 2 & 4-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThen, the characteristic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}1-\\lambda  & -2 \\\\ 2 & 4-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (1-\\lambda )(4-\\lambda )-2\\cdot (-2) & =0 \\\\ 4-\\lambda -4\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+4 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-5\\lambda +8 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446742 1068 #edb/ref 17592186446725 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446742 1069 "q-12293" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446742 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446742 1071 "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix \n$P=[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -5\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446742 1072 #uuid "95ae8df3-3e3d-5382-b3db-f47a4094753f" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446742 1074 "Let's start by writing the matrix $P-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nP-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-5-\\lambda  & 1 \\\\ 1 & -5-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(P-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(P-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-5-\\lambda  & 1 \\\\ 1 & -5-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-5-\\lambda )(-5-\\lambda )-1\\cdot 1 & =0 \\\\ 25+5\\lambda +5\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}-1 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+10\\lambda +24 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quadratic formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lambda  & =\\frac{-10\\pm \\sqrt{{10}^{2}-4\\cdot 1\\cdot 24}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-10\\pm \\sqrt{4}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-10\\pm 2}{2} \\\\  & =-6,-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =-4.$" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446743 1068 #edb/ref 17592186446716 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446743 1069 "q-107001" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446743 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446743 1071 "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$C=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -18\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446743 1072 #uuid "c0119bb7-296f-5cbc-ac52-c9d22940b932" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446743 1074 "Let's start by writing the matrix $C-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nC-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}6-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 0 & -18-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(C-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(C-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}6-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 0 & -18-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (6-\\lambda )(-18-\\lambda )-0\\cdot 0 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -6)(\\lambda +18) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =-18$ and $\\lambda =6.$\n\n**Note:** The eigenvalues of a triangular (or diagonal) matrix are the entries on the main diagonal." 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446744 1068 #edb/ref 17592186446730 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446744 1069 "q-106947" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446744 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446744 1071 "Find the characteristic equation of the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 9 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446744 1072 #uuid "c2d1ce53-250c-556e-b39c-e7210e507a13" 13194139534980 17592186045417 true] [17592186446744 1074 "First, we find the matrix $\\,A-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nA-\\lambda I=[\\begin{